sg_id":"b96c4a9a-752c-4732-8f12-a33087324cec","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"処理が終わったら done を呼んで redraw を許可、そうじゃなくても 5sec を最大としてタイムアウトするみたいな。。。","ts":"1633684209.019400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wf6d6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adbe1cd5-c506-4c14-9834-b0c98a91028f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"`call avoid_redraw({ done -\u0026gt; s:process(done) }, 5000)` みたいな感じで redraw を抑止できるといいんですけどねー。","ts":"1633684181.018800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1AM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f78a28f3-e6f1-4f97-8bbd-328e0d6d2ff3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"feedkeysやtimer周りの闇の技術はほんとヤバいなと","ts":"1633684122.018100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YzQ7I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cdbad3fb-1f3a-4723-a716-d043b3c40f4e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ただ、個人的に timer を使うと間に redraw が挟まる余地ができてしまって、ちょっとちらつく場合があるので避けたいなというお気持ちがあった感じですｗ","ts":"1633683758.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wu="}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0085a6c-c8a3-4ae6-870f-487d53d84793","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これについては実はタイマーが一番安定するんですよね。「CompleteDone が発火した契機となるキーをやり過ごしてから、行を復元し、展開処理を行う」となるというｗ","ts":"1633683735.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xCed"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f099b642-d069-49ef-920b-50f02d750699","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"直感的には timer が一番やばそうw","ts":"1633683415.016200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AqS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01543db5-a0c2-429f-89ba-41e96b091414","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"いろいろあるようだし、timer 使うのが一番安定かなあ。。。","ts":"1633683350.015900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UY0U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17ab78e2-263e-432c-9853-944a1572f7b2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"今のところ `\\\u0026lt;Nop\u0026gt;` を入れるのが一番マシですが。。。うーん。。。","ts":"1633682462.015600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dqo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4871978-30b5-4bd8-8510-e693a84594d4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"getchar もだめかもわからんです。。。どうなっているのか。。。","ts":"1633682393.015200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P=DC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a3311fd-cbf9-4caf-9d0e-b544a943a5f6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なにもわからない","ts":"1633682130.014900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4VMl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e64599b7-8c05-4608-a1fd-a6ebc5bd1e39","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あれ、‘i’ フラグ立ててもだめだった。。。（何が起こっているのやら。。。）","ts":"1633682114.014700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TRET"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3895328-7a85-4411-b06d-b3c3bd954f73","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なるほど。それでいけるかもしれません。（確定処理が走ってしまう。というのは変わりませんが）","ts":"1633682065.014400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lDc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02c99315-da09-4eb9-8b43-5c89798ece42","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"feedkeys() の i オプションです","ts":"1633682045.014000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2/DoH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74c1f847-7d1e-4a5d-8af6-93de10d618e8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"と言うか、ユーザー入力の前に必要な処理を割り込ませるのではうまくいかないんですっけ","ts":"1633682028.013700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WrX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f30e848e-b791-463b-a73a-acb5c0559962","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これ、意図したとおりに動作させようと思うと、completedone のタイミングで `getchar()` ループして、すべての先行入力を手に入れて `\u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt;` / `\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;` が含まれていたキャンセルし、`getchar()` で手に入れた文字は改めて feed しなおす。とかしかない気がしますね。","ts":"1633681992.013200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uDPW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0d3a8ce-29d2-4ea9-81a0-39c5dc8598eb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ユーザー入力の前に処理するのではダメなんですっけ","ts":"1633681951.012300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"36Na"}]},{"client_msg_id":"919f5d2a-6c2a-4a58-861f-db09f74ee1e8","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ちなみに自分が発覚した経緯ですが、補完メニュー選択を下に移動するのは \u0026lt;c-n\u0026gt; だけど間違って \u0026lt;c-k\u0026gt; 押したからでした(ctrlp が選択が c-j と c-k)","ts":"1633681927.011700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UR=b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"141e6b36-2ab0-48c7-9395-112fb5a34f04","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あー候補を選択した後のユーザー入力が始まる前になんか処理を挟まないといけないんですっけ(よくわかってないが)","ts":"1633681923.011600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cLozH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ecd3874-2689-448d-b8a8-b5a54eb72960","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なので、上記の `\\\u0026lt;Nop\u0026gt;` ハックも微妙だと思いますね。（結局、スニペット展開が発動しちゃっているので。。。）","ts":"1633681857.009900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uw44"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e4b46ab-02fe-4ecb-9a39-851b8de1d42c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"こういう状態なのだと思われます。","ts":"1633681837.009300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zwQO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"901d80b5-aad2-4eae-927c-597c4afa4adf","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらく、\n1. 補完候補が表示される\n2. 補完候補を \u0026lt;C-n\u0026gt; などで選択する\n3. その状態で一旦満足。スニペット展開なんかはしてほしくない。\n4. この状態でそのまま `\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;` や `\u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt;` で続けて入力作業をしたい","ts":"1633681833.009100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E2l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9956c206-ef45-417b-9143-96bdc4581cae","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそもなんで `\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;` を押したんですかね? `\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;` 直後の文字がエスケープされるのは Vim の仕様なので、仕様ですでいい気もするんですが","ts":"1633681783.008100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z+djo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c1f73c3-2be7-483f-aa0d-00f85fc30904","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```  call feedkeys(\"\\\u0026lt;Nop\u0026gt;\\\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr)\", '')```\nこれをフィードすると \u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt;/\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt; をキャンセルすることができました。（それでいいのか感はありますが。。。）","ts":"1633681763.007400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZKj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7049fe59-369b-436f-b4e0-92c0bfd9ebeb","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"_ちょいちょい \u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;/\u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt; で `\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;=...` がそのまま挿入されてしまう。という報告を受けているからですね。","ts":"1633681724.006400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Fh41"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02569725-cbef-4e01-8390-6f49e0f90475","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;` の次はマッピングも無視されるわけなので、それはそうと言う感じもする。そもそもなんで `\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;` が先に来ちゃうようなシチュエーションを考慮しないといけないんですっけ","ts":"1633681655.005800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TUnr8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21d817f8-3a62-45ec-8242-e8794373f931","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"変わらず。。。","ts":"1633681647.005600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l2PL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8bf8067-6efb-4822-bbef-77c7fdadaa9e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"まてよ、それこそ、先行入力に \u0026lt;Ignore\u0026gt; 入れたらいいのかな。（純粋に \u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt;/\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt; がキャンセルされちゃう可能性もありますが。。。）","ts":"1633681626.005100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ovH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0536c310-a0ec-4de4-aca7-a5e5a83811c4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そんな感じがしますね。。。","ts":"1633681589.004000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U3w0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61abd3d4-3216-40ac-9de3-b5ded983d03f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"謎でもないか。やっぱり食われていて、結果として特殊な文字だったからそのまま出た感じかなぁ","ts":"1633681568.003500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JFp1Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99a69220-2b8e-4341-ae57-bc9b3b92afb8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":nazo:","ts":"1633681508.002900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"59My"}]},{"client_msg_id":"501194a9-9190-4967-9d4c-496b0906b6f3","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt; や \u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt; を押下した場合、`\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr)` が入っちゃいますね。（何も食われていない。。。）","ts":"1633681496.002700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ssg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddab0b2e-57bc-443c-a261-6883e1009556","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これを挟めば、\u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt; 中は無視できると思ったのですが。。。うーむ。","ts":"1633681461.002200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wOkS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"790ed3bb-6444-4c61-a22d-a71f4d9cfcf8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"となるとやはり \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt; の最初の文字が食われてる?","ts":"1633681461.002100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z3ywL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"857838d0-481f-4c66-aa73-033dd93a340a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```inoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\nxnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\nnnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\ncnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\nonoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\ntnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\nlnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\nfunction! s:on_complete_done_expr() abort\n  echomsg string({ 'mode': mode(1) })\n  if mode() == 'i'\n    return printf(\"\\\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;=\u0026lt;SNR\u0026gt;%d_on_complete_done_after()\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\", s:SID())\n  end\n  return \"\\\u0026lt;Ignore\u0026gt;\"\nendfunction```\n","ts":"1633681443.001400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jo6r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9b85861-1387-4d71-81fb-9506db6ef393","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"feedkeys 側はこうなっております。","ts":"1633681436.001200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z8j="}]},{"client_msg_id":"35ced1df-8af6-4c7c-baa7-fa02d1aaecee","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```  call feedkeys(\"\\\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr)\", '')```\n","ts":"1633681432.001000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A88"}]},{"client_msg_id":"443f0637-ca41-4ccd-a217-6b148edc53f4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"feedkeys() 側に n を付けたりはしてない?","ts":"1633681411.000600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qZ7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42561e19-1008-4f7d-bdba-9adc1e598ae3","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```inoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\nxnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\nnnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\ncnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\nonoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\ntnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()\nlnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(lsp-ui-completion-on_complete_done_expr) \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;on_complete_done_expr()```\nこれを書いてみましたが、だめかもしれません。","ts":"1633681363.000200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"slR2i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33d92cab-ac28-486b-b2c2-e24bc364bbf1","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"うおお。だめかもしれない。。。\u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt;/\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt; 待機中に `\u0026lt;Plug(...)` を feedkeys するとそれがそのまま印字される可能性。（どうやってその状態のマッピングを定義すればいいかわからない。。。）","ts":"1633681320.499800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"165"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42b7e9f0-7295-412a-b75c-5bdc2f35c4b1","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"試したのが\n```VIM - Vi IMproved 8.2 (2019 Dec 12, compiled Sep 28 2021 11:18:09)\nIncluded patches: 1-3458```\nなので古くないはず。","ts":"1633681048.499000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"540"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95f2e358-beaa-4450-88ff-3e99a79e317c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Cmdマッピングに対応してないバージョンのサポートはもう切りましたね…","ts":"1633680967.498700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R4YL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d69d831e-94cc-4fae-a9f8-c8658ce3aac6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"古い Vim のサポートどんどん切ろう","ts":"1633680934.498000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0ip"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ff3706b-8ce2-4844-875a-7af784d7638b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"承知しました！","ts":"1633680861.497700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nsLRt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df5b8139-f620-4f1c-99e8-c4c26ec6006a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"「いけた〜〜」っていうのは pum.vim （や、nvim-cmp の独自補完メニュー）のテキスト挿入処理側のコンテキストでした。\nアイデアは同じように使えると思うのでこれから vim-lsp の `\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;/\u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt;` 問題に応用できないか試すフェーズです。","ts":"1633680829.497500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fDKX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bfa37e2-e81a-4034-9cbb-52107baa7760","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt; はまだ試していませんが、古い vim で動作しないと思うので \u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;/\u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt; 問題の対応では使えない気がします。","ts":"1633680766.496500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"je4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a282c69c-47e2-41de-86c0-19fbe5a2d0ed","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;` だとダメなのはなんでなんでしょうね。不思議","ts":"1633680695.495900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kIO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c23fef0-117e-4619-abac-a31b85cbc4ce","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt; や \u0026lt;C-k\u0026gt; 処理後にモードがどうなっているか次第ではこれで切り分けられるかもしれない。","ts":"1633680592.495500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qYzmQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff3a44cd-e571-4de4-9e15-35686533cff0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"1. 現状は、`\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;=...\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` を直接 feedkeys している\n2. しかし、typeahead 次第では `\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;=...\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` を実行してほしくないことがある\n3. そのため、`\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;=...\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` or `\u0026lt;Ignore\u0026gt;` を返却する expr-mapping を定義して、それを feedkeys で積んでおく\n4. こうすると、実際に `\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;=...\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` を実行するタイミング（typeahead の順番待ち解決後）に、insert-mode のままであるかどうか？を確認して処理を中断できる","ts":"1633680528.494900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"btoQe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69fabff4-a268-4139-9f04-e064e56f8caa","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"方針としては","ts":"1633680414.492600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EVos"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c3d5c63-9143-4faf-813a-a7765de06172","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"了解です。","ts":"1633680409.492400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pr+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7131e0c5-c7f8-4c5d-8906-75d1ba054ea2","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あれでしたら閉じてくださいー","ts":"1633680403.492200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SY1R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"833c89e0-522a-4b79-9b45-e01fd77e607e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"お。PR どうしましょうかね。","ts":"1633680394.491500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zy/X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74f1387a-d940-47e5-9e6d-4cba42e1a18d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"いや、いけるのかな。","ts":"1633680392.491400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=3M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddface82-0c57-4ae6-8499-c4616f4dd5ba","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ただ、これを vim-lsp の件に適用できるかというと。。。","ts":"1633680380.491100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hKHp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0779e03e-2470-47ff-9079-fa29e30447c7","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"めちゃくちゃ気持ち悪い方法で対応できました。","ts":"1633680360.490800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Pp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e0fd205-d9ea-436a-ad76-3dc18f90c673","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"dot repeatがnormal前提なのかな...まあややこしくなりそう","ts":"1633679932.490600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FXgO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"910db58b-7d45-4222-a3bb-d444c5e6d7cd","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"dot-repeatable で、insert-mode で使えて、バッファのテキストを同期的に変更する。という方法は存在しないという結論になってしまいそう。","ts":"1633679885.490000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uTv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2987dfd-c4ae-4b16-a6aa-f6b613b70a4b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ひぇー","ts":"1633678704.489300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"98T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a57651a5-08e9-415e-a882-ee597d666daf","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やはり x! は不可思議な状態をつくる気がしますね。。。(T_T)","ts":"1633678147.489100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cnf1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68cad4d6-7072-40df-8bf7-08384c019c5c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"便利そう (便利とは言っていない)","ts":"1633672436.488700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=P+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"baaf09f7-f67e-489f-aca7-b9212ac14db5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"helpに!が便利そうに書いてあるのはあまりよくないと思ってる","ts":"1633672169.488400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OTwg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab0f4c24-1eb8-44fe-a484-69f5792de573","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"wait だとマッピングの実行が止まる認識がある","ts":"1633669824.487700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kiken","count":1,"users":["U03C6TEAZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WAm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5549f24-a375-4838-9d55-32462c205fde","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"（キーマッピングの完了を待つ方法が切望されていました…）","ts":"1633669803.487100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ukj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"168ae78c-0847-4ed2-af36-110af6fdbe20","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"いけるならめちゃめちゃ便利な可能性がある。","ts":"1633669781.486300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6TaK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d5ec313-bf0e-48e2-8fb3-69edeff0d723","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"家に帰ったら必ず試してみます！","ts":"1633669768.485800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zkap"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1189c4d4-af62-4f77-a6f8-1f5183ecafab","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なるほど。typeahead 消費には使える可能性。","ts":"1633669758.485400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VIT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0602e2ec-d556-46e2-a59e-5e632dd8b4f2","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"順番見てないので、一回 `feedkeys('', 'x!')` でtypeahead を消化してから実行した方が良さそう。","ts":"1633669731.484500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/hlH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79352291-34ef-4194-8dc4-c48920d35f19","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"! 何度か試したことあるんですが、待機状態？的な謎の状態になってしまうので、普通の利用には適さないのかなぁと思ってます。","ts":"1633669711.484000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X3P3/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bc2dc6f-f8d8-47da-a9eb-e1a792e254c0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1633669637.481900","files":[{"id":"F02GX4B6TAA","created":1633669635,"timestamp":1633669635,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U03C6TEAZ","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"exter