1D7H","text":"`x!`","ts":"1633669423.481300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TyO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97697c98-2f97-418b-8aa0-f00a2f0d5e30","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"テストで使うならこの挙動でもよいのだろうけど","ts":"1633669081.481100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZAFT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bcb6fdef-cf9d-461d-b4ab-441d3ac4b9d3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"だから挙動がおかしくなるのか","ts":"1633669067.480600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qV3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ffdfdd0-4cb6-4b9b-9c14-7cb4e51b47c3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あー、なるほど","ts":"1633669059.480300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u3nY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06275bb1-f813-49ff-ac53-3bc0ba49fbca","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"feedkeys x の実行後はノーマルモードに戻ってしまうというにんしきがあります。これがなければめちゃくちゃ便利なのですが…","ts":"1633669024.480000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g5sI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf3fa96c-c16e-4178-a6b5-433fd3fda6ab","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"feedkeys xはプラグインで使っても挙動がよくわからず使いどころが難しい","ts":"1633667683.478800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NrW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54fd5c9a-7325-4bf0-b06e-fb4713d4abde","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こんな。","ts":"1633666210.478100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jG5L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4f38b5f-caff-47b4-a6b8-feaa4a70f7e7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```diff --git a/autoload/lsp/ui/vim/completion.vim b/autoload/lsp/ui/vim/completion.vim\nindex 8d3a8f7..af23654 100644\n--- a/autoload/lsp/ui/vim/completion.vim\n+++ b/autoload/lsp/ui/vim/completion.vim\n@@ -54,6 +54,7 @@ function! s:on_complete_done() abort\n   let s:context['complete_position'] = l:managed_user_data['complete_position']\n   let s:context['server_name'] = l:managed_user_data['server_name']\n   let s:context['completion_item'] = l:managed_user_data['completion_item']\n+  call feedkeys('', 'x')\n   call feedkeys(printf(\"\\\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;=\u0026lt;SNR\u0026gt;%d_on_complete_done_after()\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\", s:SID()), 'n')\n endfunction\n ```","ts":"1633666209.477900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r=by3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5DEE6591-57EF-4533-B55B-721E2F50DE45","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"cmd はダメそうでした。","ts":"1633666101.477600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8q6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5e9d0c0-e5e6-47bf-b0c7-3f73af7741cd","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ようは先行するキーの続きとして `\u0026lt;C-R\u0026gt;=` の `\u0026lt;C-R\u0026gt;` が食われてるって話だと思うので。","ts":"1633666016.477100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0sMH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c5253cd-3879-423c-8208-b8291774ea93","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"feedkeys の `x` ってこういう用途には使えないんだっけ。","ts":"1633665951.476200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wes"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9d1dafd-3c0b-41f8-83a2-fb4f275d7395","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"今だとCmd使った方がよいのではないかと思います","ts":"1633647769.475800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sX="}]},{"client_msg_id":"cebc5109-8a66-42c6-9dbf-73002540f467","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"モード変更するからですね。だからC-rだったのだろうと推測","ts":"1633647753.475200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P0d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81277ec8-a7a0-4d22-82f1-5e4c30e94208","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ESCだと副作用があります","ts":"1633647732.474500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LDgt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67cae213-39ce-4c5b-8d58-3141033427a4","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"ありがとうございます！！","ts":"1633701404.029100","thread_ts":"1633701307.028300","parent_user_id":"U03C6TEAZ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pu=Y"}]}]
